# Image staging area — drop originals here for review; they are never committed.
# Only the optimized WebP derived from them (16:9, <=880px) is, under
# public/assets/exam/<theme>/.../img/. See .claude/memory/picture-description-theme.md
public/assets/tmp/

# Audio sneakernet archive — `npm run pack-audio` output. Regenerable from the
# local mp3 corpus, so it is transferred by scp, never committed.
/audio-transfer/
